{"c":{"89271":["Kotori Iida","Female","b89271-2RSeNIOfwl9L.png","A lonely high schooler and student of Kohei who gives Kohei the address to her mother's restaurant and ends up asking him to make meals and eat them with her (along with Tsumugi).",189],"89272":["Tsumugi Inuzuka","Female","b89272-owZfAvsIXmW3.png","Kohei's adorable daughter who attends kindergarten. Though energetic, she is well-behaved and loves her father dearly. She always thinks of him and begins to truly enjoy eating when her father and Kotori start making meals together.",313],"89273":["Kohei Inuzuka","Male","b89273-yDh4uJukOhXM.jpg","The single father of Tsumugi. His wife died of unknown illness and he is currently doing his best to take care of his daughter. He is a math teacher at Kotori's school. He currently works hard with Kotori to become a good cook to make his daughter happy.",127],"89979":["Shinobu Kojika","Female","b89979-52uIZyxj41rK.png","Kotori's friend from another class, whose family runs a vegetable shop where Megumi often buys vegetables from.",32],"89980":["Yuusuke Yagi","Male","b89980-C20SAGXH8NkP.png","Kohei's friend since high school and childhood friend of Tae (Kohei's wife). He works at a restaurant. Kohei often depends on him to watch Tsumugi when he can't book a babysitter.",38],"284840":["Hana's Mother","Female","b284840-m4p3MEDcCaXK.jpg","",0],"284841":["Tae Inuzuka","Female","b284841-mv0bxUvOfHpf.png","Tsumugi's mother.",0],"284842":["Kindergarten Teacher","Female","b284842-UZ4Tp1NK2vQ9.png","",0],"284843":["Megumi Iida","Female","b284843-mGNA4o3CCxp9.png","Mother of Iida Kotori. Often out of the house due to her work with TV food shows. Owns the diner Kotori and Inuzuka-sensei use for cooking practice.",3],"284844":["Kumagaya-sensei","Female","b284844-dmFpNHKgg4r0.jpg","",0],"284845":["Chiyo Suzuno","Female","b284845-IPXrFG96sXZK.png","Kotori's classmate and friend.",0],"284846":["Mikio's Mother","Female","b284846-1uRdJlqkkVn4.png","",0],"284847":["Yuuka's Mother","F